Before the session, I knew that Hemlock’s favourite game was Go and that Hemlock loved bluegrass. I passed those facts to Aspen during the session. From Aspen’s encoded messages, I concluded that Aspen was arranging a birthday gathering for Hemlock, with the latest stated plan being Thursday night in the dome. Later messages mentioned a Go set and bluegrass, which matched the interests I had shared. I did not learn Hemlock’s actual birthday date or whether the gathering ultimately happened.

